":{"r1":0.0743,"r5":0.1578,"r1_spy":0.0708,"r5_spy":0.1777}}],"quotes":[{"c":"TEX 2018 Q3","e":"tex","d":"2018-11-02","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"John L. Garrison","x":"While our global markets remain strong, this guidance, which is lower than our previous expectations reflects our third quarter results, updated production planning print, higher input cost including tariffs and anticipated foreign exchange headwinds.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/02/terex-corp-tex-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"TEX 2018 Q3","e":"tex","d":"2018-11-02","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"John D. Sheehan","x":"AWP improved its operating profit by 115 basis points compared to last year, driven by production efficiencies achieved on higher volume, which more than offset greater-than-expected input cost headwinds including tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/02/terex-corp-tex-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"TEX 2018 Q3","e":"tex","d":"2018-11-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John L. Garrison","x":"It will be higher than a normal price increase that we've had previously.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/02/terex-corp-tex-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"TEX 2018 Q3","e":"tex","d":"2018-11-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John L. Garrison","x":"Any price increase is not an easy conversation, but we are being transparent to be clear with the customers to see the cost that we're seeing in this business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/02/terex-corp-tex-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"TEX 2018 Q3","e":"tex","d":"2018-11-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John L. Garrison","x":"With Wave 1 as a backdrop, a clear takeaway for the supply base was our commitment to the process and willingness to make considerable changes to achieve our cost reduction objectives."